<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 76,704.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 76,704.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Nov 6 totaled 76,704 bales, up from 76,576 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 128 bales issued, 1,417 decertification orders, no cancellations, and 64 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
